{% if render_mode == "full" %}
{#
  Example 02: gossip about the player's recent good deeds.

  user_final_instructions submodules are added at the end of the prompt, the place for short,
  situational guidance. This one reads a global StorageUtil list: "none" as the form means
  StorageUtil's global scope (None in Papyrus).
#}
{% set deeds = papyrus_util("GetStringList", "none", "ExC_RecentDeeds") %}
{% if length(deeds) > 0 %}
- Word has it {{ player.name }} has been generous lately ({% for deed in deeds %}{{ deed }}{% if not loop.is_last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}). Mention it only if it fits the conversation.
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
